       Floods v2.0
       by H-Master

Want to get back at someone on IRC?  Well this is the tool for you!
Floods allows you to flood someone off in just a few seconds!

        Features:
 1. Direct IRC connection.
 2. Configurable.
 3. Complete control over ALL the bots
 4. Unlimited (except by your memory) number of clones with only ONE program.
 5. Super fast.
 6. Random nicks.
 7. Automatic flood protection for ALL bots.
 8. Automatically stops flooding after the person is gone.
10. 21 different floods at 3 different flood levels.
11. Includes a list of hacks/backdoors for common scripts/bots/clients.
12. Floodnet support.
13. Others features found in most other flooding programs.
14. FREEWARE!!!

This may be the LAST version of Floods, so grab it now!

